{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pdVD1GyTUJ1793195194.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>以色列大選仍在點票，預料要籌組聯合政府。</p><p></p><p>以色列傳媒根據已點算的逾七成選票，推算執政聯盟將獲得54個席位，反對派陣營獲得49席，阿拉伯裔政黨席均無法取得國會120個議席中，得過半數的61席，要籌組聯合政府執政，阿拉伯裔政黨預計取得17席，成為「造王者」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:41.846672+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.136907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:22.521169+00:00","content_hash":"31090d4278dc51f8329b3b964b833f1aa14243954ecc48498bf97cdf7bfba104","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:41.846672+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}